@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-07
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-07 Two state machines\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nMsess stop classes versus Mprot operation states; joined only by observation

state Msess as "Msess verification session" {
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Select
  Select --> Execute : chosen t
  Execute --> Update : valid Izk
  Execute --> Prep : preparatory action
  Execute --> StopError : ERROR
  Prep --> Select : qk changed
  Update --> Select : |Hk| > 1 and distinguisher exists
  Update --> StopBudget : budget or Kmax exhausted
  Update --> StopNoDistinguisher : no currently usable distinguisher
  Update --> StopEquivalent : observational equivalence established
  Update --> StopSingleton : |Hk| == 1
  Update --> StopEmpty : Hk empty
  Update --> Stop645 : named 645-blocked item
}

state Mprot as "Mprot protocol operation" {
  [*] --> Information
  Information --> Upload
  Information --> MediaDownload : Media Defined DOWNLOAD
  Information --> OperatorDownload : Operator Defined DOWNLOAD
  Information --> Find : FIND
  Upload --> AbortReject
  MediaDownload --> AbortReject
  OperatorDownload --> AbortReject
  Find --> AbortReject
}

Msess --> Mprot : Execute stimulus / Prep
Mprot --> Msess : observation Izk and qk
note bottom of Msess
  Stop classes: Stop-Budget, Stop-NoDistinguisher, Stop-Equivalent,
  Stop-Singleton, Stop-Empty, Stop-Error, Stop-645.
  Do not copy UPLOAD/FIND states into Msess.
  Bound M2 is an UPLOAD/INFORMATION protocol model, not Msess.
end note
@enduml
